    "name": "Polish White Garlic (Dried and Cured)",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Polish White Garlic has a rich, earthy, and full-bodied taste with a light-to-medium heat and a fresh green quality. It is an artichoke softneck variety that provides a classic, versatile garlic profile for cooking. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Taste Profile:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Deep, rich, and musky-earthy with subtle fresh herbal notes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pungency:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Light to medium heat that gives a mild bite without being overwhelming.</span></p>",
